@startuml SD03
title SD03 – Dang ky Thuc tap (Sinh vien)

actor "Sinh vien" as SV
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend" as BE
participant "Python CV" as PY
database "Database" as DB

SV -> FE : Xem dot thuc tap dang mo
FE -> BE : GET /api/registration-periods/check
BE --> FE : Thoi han dang ky hop le

SV -> FE : Upload file CV (PDF)
FE -> BE : POST /api/sinh-vien/upload-cv
BE -> PY : Xac thuc quyen so huu CV\n(kiem tra ten/ma SV trong file)
PY --> BE : CV hop le
BE -> DB : Luu duong dan CV

SV -> FE : Dien nguyen vong & vi tri mong muon
FE -> BE : POST /api/sinh-vien/register-internship
BE -> DB : Kiem tra dieu kien tin chi\nva tao don dang ky (cho-duyet)
BE --> FE : 201 Dang ky thanh cong
FE --> SV : Hien thi trang thai "Cho duyet"
@enduml
